{"rally": "<section class=\"page\" data-page=\"rally\"><div class=\"crumb\"><div class=\"wrap\"><button class=\"back\" data-back=\"home\">&#8592; Back<span class=\"bn\"> to Resources</span></button><span class=\"csep\"></span><button data-go=\"home\">Resources</button><span class=\"sep\">›</span><span>TH Rally</span></div></div><div class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-h\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Browse</div><h2>TH Rally</h2></div><div class=\"rgrid\"><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>Elul (month)</b><span>The King is in the Field</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>18 Elul</b><span>Chai Elul — Baal Shem Tov & Alter Rebbe</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>20 Cheshvan</b><span>Rebbe Rashab</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>1 Kislev</b><span>The Rebbe's return, 5738</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>14 Kislev</b><span>The Rebbe's wedding</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>19 Kislev</b><span>Rosh Hashanah of Chassidus</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>Chanukah</b><span>Festival of Lights</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rDidan\"><b>5 Teves</b><span>Didan Notzach</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>24 Teves</b><span>Alter Rebbe yahrzeit</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>10 Shevat</b><span>Yud Shevat</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>22 Shevat</b><span>Rebbetzin Chaya Mushka</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>Purim Koton</b><span>14 Adar I</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>9 Adar</b><span>Frierdiker Rebbe to the US</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>27 Adar</b><span>5752</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>Purim</b><span>14 Adar</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>11 Nissan</b><span>Birthday of the Rebbe — promotions at 770</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>Lag B'Omer</b><span>Children's parade</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button><button class=\"rc\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>28 Sivan</b><span>The Rebbe to America</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>Gimmel Tammuz</b><span>Rebbe yahrzeit</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button><button class=\"rc sug\" data-go=\"rally\"><b>12–13 Tammuz</b><span>Frierdiker Rebbe's liberation</span><span class=\"sg\">suggested</span></button></div></div></div></section>", "rDidan": "<section class=\"page\" data-page=\"rDidan\"><div class=\"crumb\"><div class=\"wrap\"><button class=\"back\" data-back=\"rally\">&#8592; Back<span class=\"bn\"> to TH Rally</span></button><span class=\"csep\"></span><button data-go=\"home\">Resources</button><span class=\"sep\">›</span><button data-go=\"rally\">TH Rally</button><span class=\"sep\">›</span><span>5 Teves</span></div></div><div class=\"sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"max-width:820px\"><div class=\"sec-h\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Rally · 5 Teves</div><h2>Didan Notzach</h2><p>Fifteen minutes of commanding, ready to run. The same five parts as the Yoma Depagra package, sequenced.</p></div><div class=\"ros\"><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><div><h4>Niggun</h4><div style=\"font-family:'Saira Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px\">YD Niggunim · 2 min</div><p>Open with the melody of the date. The platoon already knows it from the week it was featured.</p></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><div><h4>The Twelve Pesukim</h4><div style=\"font-family:'Saira Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px\">4 min</div><p>A soldier leads each posuk, one word at a time; the platoon repeats. A different soldier each posuk.</p></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><div><h4>The Story</h4><div style=\"font-family:'Saira Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px\">YD Comics · YD Stories · YD Timelines · 5 min</div><p>Read the comic aloud, or tell it from the timeline if you are short on time.</p></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">4</div><div><h4>Activity</h4><div style=\"font-family:'Saira Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px\">YD Game · 2 min</div><p>Spot the five differences. Two minutes, then answers.</p></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">5</div><div><h4>The Mission</h4><div style=\"font-family:'Saira Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px\">1 min</div><p>Announce it, then close.</p><div class=\"say\">“Your missions continue. Report to me.”</div></div></div></div><div class=\"sh mt\">The Twelve Pesukim, in order</div><div class=\"dl\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">1</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">תּוֹרָה צִוָּה לָנוּ מֹשֶׁה</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">2</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">שְׁמַע יִשְׂרָאֵל</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">3</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">בְּכָל דּוֹר וָדוֹר</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">4</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">כִּי קָרוֹב אֵלֶיךָ</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">5</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">וְאָהַבְתָּ לְרֵעֲךָ כָּמוֹךָ</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">6</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">כָּל יִשְׂרָאֵל יֵשׁ לָהֶם חֵלֶק</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">7</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">בְּרֵאשִׁית בָּרָא אֱלֹקִים</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">8</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">וְשִׁנַּנְתָּם לְבָנֶיךָ</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">9</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">יִשְׂמַח יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּעֹשָׂיו</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">10</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">וְזֶה שֶׁגָּרַם</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">11</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">יָגַעְתִּי וּמָצָאתִי תַּאֲמִין</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"t\">12</div><div class=\"heb\" style=\"font-size:19px\">בְּרוּכִים אַתֶּם לַה׳</div></div></div><p class=\"srcline\">Content for this rally will fill from the Hachayol issue for that date. Order of the Twelve Pesukim to be confirmed against the official Tzivos Hashem card before print.</p></div></div></div></section>"}